    "enUS": {
      "description": "If you wish to take on this task, present Lydros with the dull blade.",
      "dialogue": {
        "9f67240cd3299d53ba05": "Excellent, let us begin...",
        "bdc47b966b238af5d337": "If you manage to enter the lair of the dragon, heat the blade under her fiery breath, and ultimately temper it in her blood, I shall bind the blade for your use."
      },
      "summary": "Give the Dull and Flat Elven Blade to Lorekeeper Lydros.",
